{
  "$comment": "The 14 categories of the preset bank. poly: default voices; audition: loop the UI plays; analysis/seconds/probes/hold: how the critic measures the category (its loop, its register as low/mid/high MIDI notes, held-note length); decaying: notes are meant to die away (life is judged more gently). limits: critic overrides for the category. zone: the LORN fingerprint (vibe measurements the category's presets must land in). Mud limits are higher for mid-register categories (keys, pluck, arp, bells): their notes' fundamentals sit in the 200-400 Hz mud band, so energy there is the instrument, not build-up.",
